                   quent calls to ggssss__ddiissppllaayy__ssttaattuuss(), passing the same
                   _s_t_a_t_u_s___v_a_l_u_e, _s_t_a_t_u_s___t_y_p_e, _m_e_c_h___t_y_p_e, and _m_e_s_s_a_g_e___c_o_n_t_e_x_t
                   parameters.

     status_string
                   Textual interpretation of the _s_t_a_t_u_s___v_a_l_u_e.  Storage asso‐
                   ciated with this parameter must be freed by the application
                   after use with a call to ggssss__rreelleeaassee__bbuuffffeerr().

